# M5b's narrow window (plan section 6): at 460 x 900 the page stacks (under 900), the rows drop
# their names (ParamRow.module.css @media max-width 469px), the theme chip goes (ThemeChip.module.css,
# under 640) and the wordmark keeps only its icon (TopBar.module.css, under 520); the subtitle,
# wider than what is left of the bar, ends in an ellipsis (text-overflow). Shot at rest.
size 460 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot narrow
